[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1521670424","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1926#issuecomment-1521670424","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1926","id":1521670424,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85astkY","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-04-25T12:01:53Z","updated_at":"2023-04-25T12:01:53Z","body":"I'm +1 to add, as a short permissive / historical notice in use in Fedora.\r\n\r\nFor the name / ID, I would probably suggest \"Xfig License\" and `Xfig` as ID rather than `MIT-Xfig`. Although it might bear some practical similarities to `MIT`, there are also differences (such as the lack of the liability disclaimers paragraph at the end of `MIT`). Perhaps best to just call it `Xfig`.\r\n\r\nFrom a bit of poking, it looks like https://sourceforge.net/p/mcj/xfig/ci/master/tree/src/Makefile.am is one example of use from the original Xfig project, so might be worth including this URL (or another one from that repo) in the cross-references.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1521670424/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1538722906","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1926#issuecomment-1538722906","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1926","id":1538722906,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85btwxa","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-05-08T16:55:58Z","updated_at":"2023-05-08T16:55:58Z","body":"+1 to add as well. I'm surprised we didn't add this back in 2014 when we did a review of some of these for Fedora, actually. Back then we tended to adopt the Fedora shortname where possible since it was already in use, but I guess that's not critical now. I'm good with @swinslow suggestion. \r\n\r\n@richardfontana any opinions as to name? or can we call this accepted using `Xfig` ?","author_association":"MEMBER","p